{"id":"mdb3g759ogjz3uio3udwpo9y7","title":"AI4Chip：大模型厂商与芯片工程师的落地分歧","originalTitle":"想用AI造芯片？芯片工程师笑了","summary":"AI4Chip是否成立取决于真实流片和商业闭环。基模厂（如月之暗面、千问）已发布芯片设计demo，但距离主流EDA工具链的signoff仍需突破。两位专家分歧点：剁椒酱认为AI可逐步替代传统分工，晒哥强调芯片设计的物理实现和长尾需求激活才是关键。北京经开区发布AI4Chip专项政策，目标2028年形成10个标杆应用。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"钛媒体"},"links":{"original":"https://www.tmtpost.com/8205198.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T06:33:00.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-14T07:06:52.852Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-14T07:06:52.852Z","category":"macro","tags":["研究报告","半导体"],"score":60,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"霞光AI实验室","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"semiconductor","name":"半导体"},{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}